part e1_asks_02
  tally 1
  note "E1-02 · What each of us was worth, end of 2025 (tmp/cases/E1/questions.md): as of 2025-12-31, known 2026-01-15. Five of the six and the family are partial, so the known part is a second pair of asks with each missing item pinned to 0: the Lazur rate from 2025-07-01 (as A-11 does), Ola's Wrzos balance, the house ul. Leśna 4 (as D-08 leaves it out), and Jakub's other means and unpaid tax."

